{"seq":9,"slug":"facilitation-group-decision","title":"引导与群体决策","stage":"DONE","category":"negotiation-communication","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"引导与群体决策-总览\">引导与群体决策·总览</h1><p>当一群人坐在同一个房间（或同一块在线白板）面前，掌握的信息、立场、利害各不相同，却必须在有限时间内得出一个大家都愿意执行的结论时，需要的不是某一方&quot;赢&quot;，而是有人把这个集体思考的过程设计好、托住、推到终点。这就是引导（facilitation）。引导者不替群体做决定，而是为群体的决定负责——负责让每个声音进得来、让分歧暴露得出来、让收敛真实地发生。本 hub 讲的就是这门&quot;对过程负责、对内容中立&quot;的手艺，以及它服务的核心目标：群体决策。</p>\n<p>四个章节是一条递进的主线，建议按顺序读。<strong>基础</strong>先回答三个根问题：引导到底是什么、引导者为什么必须中立、一群人聚在一起会自发产生哪些动力（趋同、沉默、搭便车、地位压制），不理解群体动力学，后面所有技法都是无源之水。<strong>流程</strong>进入操作：如何为一场研讨设计议程与节奏，如何驾驭&quot;先打开再收拢&quot;的发散-收敛节律，如何在过程中管理参与——让话多的人让位、让沉默的人开口。<strong>决策方法</strong>是本 hub 的硬核：共识构建、投票与排序、以及当冲突与僵局真的卡死时怎么办；这一章把&quot;如何得出结论&quot;讲透。<strong>实践</strong>收尾于落地：可直接照搬的工作坊技法、远程与混合场景下的特殊挑战、以及最常见的陷阱与反模式。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与几个兄弟 hub 共享&quot;谈判与沟通&quot;这个大类，但分工清晰，请勿混淆。<strong>谈判（1_negotiation-theory）</strong> 处理的是两方/多方各自代表己方利益、讨价还价争取份额的局面，核心是 BATNA、ZOPA、利益与立场；而本 hub 的引导者<strong>不代表任何一方利益</strong>，只对过程负责，这是最根本的边界。<strong>冲突解决（4_conflict-resolution）</strong> 与本 hub 最易混：调解（mediation）也由中立第三方主持，但它针对的是&quot;已经爆发的双边/多边冲突&quot;的修复；本 hub 处理的是&quot;一群人为做出共同决定而进行的常态化协作&quot;，冲突只是其中一种需要处理的状况——我们在「处理冲突与僵局」一篇里点到为止，深水区交给冲突解决 hub。<strong>说服与影响（6_persuasion-influence）</strong> 教的是如何让别人接受你的观点，立场是有倾向的；引导者恰恰要克制自己的影响欲，这是一种&quot;反说服&quot;的纪律。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：若你是第一次主持会议的新手，从「基础」三篇通读到「流程」即可上手一场普通研讨；若你已能主持但常陷入&quot;会开了却没结论&quot;，直奔「决策方法」三篇；若你负责跨城团队或线上工作坊，「实践」中的远程引导一篇是你的重点。</p>\n<p>前置知识：本 hub 不要求任何专业背景，但若你先读过冲突解决 hub 的「冲突动力学」与谈判 hub 的「利益与立场」，会更容易理解群体中分歧的来源。具备基本的会议组织经验即可顺畅阅读。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-facilitation","title":"何为引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/foundations/what-is-facilitation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"facilitator-neutral-role","title":"中立引导者角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/foundations/facilitator-neutral-role"},{"seq":3,"slug":"group-dynamics","title":"群体动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/foundations/group-dynamics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"process","title":"流程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/process","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"designing-sessions","title":"设计研讨流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/process/designing-sessions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"divergent-convergent","title":"发散与收敛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/process/divergent-convergent"},{"seq":3,"slug":"managing-participation","title":"管理参与","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/process/managing-participation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"decision-methods","title":"决策方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/decision-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consensus-building","title":"共识构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/decision-methods/consensus-building"},{"seq":2,"slug":"voting-prioritization","title":"投票与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/decision-methods/voting-prioritization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"handling-conflict-deadlock","title":"处理冲突与僵局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/decision-methods/handling-conflict-deadlock"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"workshop-techniques","title":"工作坊技法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/practice/workshop-techniques"},{"seq":2,"slug":"remote-facilitation","title":"远程引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/practice/remote-facilitation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"facilitation-pitfalls","title":"陷阱与反模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/negotiation-communication/facilitation-group-decision/practice/facilitation-pitfalls"}]}]}